(pot)

::instructions

Stir (flour, for batter) gradually into (milk), carefully dissolving every lump, to make {milk and flour}.
(egg) <beat> ?= very light
Add (egg) by degrees to {milk and flour} to make {batter}.
{batter} + (salt)
    <stir, well>
(pudding-cloth) <dip, in (water)>
    <flour, with (flour, for cloth)>
Pour {batter} into (pudding-cloth), then tie it up, leaving room to swell, to make {pudding}.
